  https://github.com/mrujjwalg/movi-player

Native runtime modifications:
  Copyright 2026 KMediaPlayer contributors
  https://github.com/SuvioMedia/kmedia-wasm-runtime

Inherited movi-player portions embedded in the object files and runtime remain
subject to Apache-2.0. SuvioMedia's native shim source is private; only its
machine-readable object code is supplied for LGPL relinking. The license map,
narrow relinking permission, and third-party notices are in LICENSE,
RELINKING_TERMS.md, and LICENSES/.

This repository contains no Kotlin engine, TypeScript product, npm package, UI,
or application source. A separately distributed proprietary player is not
linked into this native WebAssembly binary.

The distributed browser artifacts include code from FFmpeg (LGPL-2.1-or-later),
dav1d (BSD-2-Clause), Emscripten, musl libc, LLVM runtime components,
Signalsmith Stretch (MIT), and zlib. These components remain under their
respective licenses.

The Maven `-sources.jar` includes the exact FFmpeg source, the object files and
prebuilt dav1d SDK used for relinking, the complete FFmpeg configure/final-link
recipe, checksums, and licenses. It intentionally contains no native shim,
Signalsmith, Kotlin, or TypeScript source. The Emscripten image is pinned by
version and multi-architecture digest. See LGPL_RELINKING.md.
